  "mappingSource": "WinWing U.32.T.MET.1 user manual section 3.2 \"Key Positions\" page 8 (https://eu.winctrl.com/static/ipfs/QmQewYduBVWvwYSvVxzH9GAseJyDfFVeUspknKwbzpeuZo): 10/11 = buttons at the outer ends of the left/right lever handles, 12-17 / 18-23 = left/right lever detents (TOGA, FLX/MCT, CL, A/THR-REV, REV, FULL), 1/2 = ENG MASTER 1 ON/OFF, 3/4 = ENG MASTER 2 ON/OFF, 5/6 = FIRE FAULT 1/2, 7/8/9 = ENG MODE CRANK/NORM/IGN START, RX = left lever, RY = right lever; catalog winwing.json identify.note",
